    card;\r\n\u25CF You: Destroy it, and if you do, add 1 Field Spell from your Deck
    to your hand with a different name.\r\n\u25CF Your opponent: Negate its effects
    (until the end of this turn), and if you do, add 1 Field Spell from your Deck
    to your hand.\r\nYou can only use each effect of \"Cosmo Queen the Queen of Prayers\"
    once per turn."
